      "en": "“Therefore listen to me, you men of understanding: far be it from God, that he should do wickedness, from the Almighty, that he should commit iniquity.",
      "ko": "그러므로 너희 총명한 자들아 내 말을 들으라 하나님은 단정코 악을 행치 아니하시며 전능자는 단정코 불의를 행치 아니하시고",
      "source_text_hash": "dc6efc5004c297f82f06af9d8d34a8f76d0cd0cd07a86204bfd19baeee27eaa7",
      "translation_text_hash": "e85b6cb366618fa5c7ef64b9e080f25ead6df02f86e8e7e7f1da206412e2cfdf",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
